{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】西環有私家車失事，撞向鐵欄後翻側，無人受傷。</p>\n<p>司機在現場協助調查。凌晨零時許，一輛私家車沿石山街往士美菲路方向行駛，駛至士美菲路巿政大廈對開時懷疑失控，撞向路邊鐵欄後翻側，車上司機及兩名男乘客自行離開車廂，警方正調查意外原因。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T00:05:18.400659+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T23:50:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T23:58:49.729008+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T23:58:49.729008+00:00","content_hash":"fd51f794a4e70dd2db8026bbc2c1d5d636ee8fcd5c4d56b686bf98a870f31f46","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}